{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Weapons|Boar $Spear}}

{{PAGENAME}} is a two-handed weapon that can be used for melee combat and can also be thrown from a distance by using [[Ranged_Combat|Shoot]].

'''Warning: {{PAGENAME}} can get randomly destroyed when it is thrown and hits something. Also you might not be able to recover it if {{PAGENAME}} hits a cliff.'''

{{PAGENAME}} gives extra range to Melee Combat moves that utilize it, allowing you to "cheese" animals from outside their attack range using a [[Boat]]. This does require careful pre-positioning though, if you use a move out of range the character  will move to collide with the target.

==How to Acquire==

First, you need to wield a [[smithy's hammer]] in one hand. Then right click an [[anvil]] and craft the spear.

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{\frac{_{q}Metal + _{q}Bough}{2} *  9 + {_{q}Anvil* 4 + _{q}Smithy's Hammer}* 3}{16}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[3]{Strength *Smithing*Marksmanship}</math>

* Damage scales with strength and weapon quality using the following formula: <math>Damage = 80*\sqrt{\sqrt{Strength*{q}Spear}/10}</math>.

==Quick Facts==

* Despite it's name, Boar Spear does not provide any special bonus when confronting furious [[Boar|Wild Boar]].

